# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for local development. Vercel holds the
# deployed values (Project Settings -> Environment Variables); a change there
# takes effect on the next build, not on a redeploy of a cached one.

# Sentry DSN for client error reporting. Public by design: it only lets a
# browser send events to the project. Leave unset to turn reporting off; a
# placeholder or malformed value fails the build.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://<key>@<org>.ingest.sentry.io/<project id>
